  "body": "Discover a hidden haven in the heart of Kohimarama, where architectural elegance meets privacy, space and effortless Bays living. Set behind secure gates and surrounded by established greenery, this Mediterranean-style home enjoys a peaceful, leafy setting just moments from the beach and local amenities.\r\n\r\nArchitecturally designed by Frans Kamermans and constructed with a cavity system, the home occupies 478sqm of freehold land. Its generous proportions and versatile layout make it equally appealing to families, professionals and those seeking an easy lock-up-and-leave lifestyle. \r\n\r\nThe upper level is dedicated to relaxed living and entertaining, featuring a light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, complemented by a separate lounge with a gas fireplace. A guest bathroom adds convenience, while an expansive, sun-drenched deck provides a seamless extension of the living spaces, perfect for entertaining or simply enjoying the peaceful, elevated leafy outlook. \r\n\r\nFour bedrooms provide flexibility for family and guests. The generous master suite features a walk-in wardrobe, ensuite and access to a private patio, while three further bedrooms and a family bathroom complete the accommodation. A double internal-access garage and additional off-street parking ensure everyday ease. Madills Farm and Kohimarama Beach are within easy walking distance, while Eastridge Shopping Centre, local cafés and convenient transport links are close by. Kohimarama School and Selwyn College further enhance the appeal of this sought-after Bays location.\r\n\r\n Elegant, spacious and privately positioned, this is a wonderful opportunity to enjoy the best of Bays living",
